WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.310
<i>There will be strong north winds tomorrow,</i>

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.230
<i>and scattered rain showers can be expected near the Pacific coast.</i>

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.980
I should bring the laundry in and let it dry inside.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:06.690
<i>Overall temperatures will be lower than in previous years.</i>
I should bring the laundry in and let it dry inside.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.190
<i>Overall temperatures will be lower than in previous years.</i>

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.320
Grandma, I'm back!
<i>Overall temperatures will be lower than in previous years.</i>

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:09.940
Grandma, I'm back!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.360
Welcome home!

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.240
I'll be borrowing Nii-chan's computer, okay?

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.490
Oh, my.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.160
Come on! Hurry it up!

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.370
I've never been good with computers...

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.080
Let's see...

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:28.820
Sent Mail
Drafts
Inbox
Folder

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.090
Date and Time

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.470
This...

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.010
No way.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.390
Is she trying to gather all the Selectors so they can battle?

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:46.020
It's really close by...

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:05.460
shinjitsu wa hitoe ni kaado no uraomote
Truth and reality are like the two sides of a card

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:10.960
tokenai mama
Forever entwined

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.780
mekurimekuru meku
Thrust upon this chaotic stage

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.720
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:20.970
memagurushii suteeji de
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way
I spin around and lose my way

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:29.020
sono karamatta kanjou wo manzoku iku made nankai mo
Until I can finally sort out these mixed-up emotions

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.280
kowashite shimae
I'll destroy it countless times

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:37.360
unmei ni temaneki sare samayou ashita wa
The uncertain future will be summoned by fate

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:42.660
nani wo erande nani wo tebanashi hitotsu ni nareba iin darou
Should I choose just one thing to let go of?

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:48.420
najitta tefuda wo sarasu yoyuu nante nai yo
I can't afford to let my sinful hand show yet

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:53.500
kawaita koukai no umi wo nomihosu hibi wa
My days of leisurely drinking from the sea of regret are long over

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:58.840
kagirareta kotoba de itsushika no egao yurushite hoshiin darou
Will you really use your one wish to return that lost smile?

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:05.060
utsutsu wo wasuretatte kamawanai yo dakara
It's no concern of mine if you avert your eyes from reality

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.810
ima wa shiranai de itai nee
So please just live in blissful ignorance

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.670
It's here somewhere, right?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.550
Yup.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:39.800
Ruuko?

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.310
Here?

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:56.030
<i>When the construction work is over, it'll be just
like they planted a big pillar in that alley, right?</i>

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.870
Ruu?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.410
What's the matter?

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:08.750
It's nothing.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.080
Ruu...

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.040
Um, Ruuko?

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.130
If there's something bothering you,

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.800
or if you have something on your mind,

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.840
just say it.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.260
Yuzuki...

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:27.100
So you think I'm... scary, too?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.480
No one can tell what I'm thinking after all...

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.310
Huh?

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.980
Wait, that's not what I meant! That's not it!

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:36.690
It's just that you always try to
keep all your burdens to yourself.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.110
Well, not like I was any different...

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.450
In any case, sorry!

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.950
And well, see this?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.330
We're friends, you know?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.330
Yuzuki...

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.540
Why are you so kind?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.620
Huh?

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.710
Wh-What are you saying? You're weirding me out.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.420
Why are you so strong?

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.840
Ruu...

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.300
If only...

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.390
I was like that.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.770
Yuzuki.

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.140
Tama.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.440
I...

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.110
I'll battle Iona-san.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.150
What are you saying?!

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.860
You said you weren't going to battle!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.240
Yes...

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.370
But...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.490
But, you know...

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.910
I have a wish now!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.870
I...

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.420
I want to save Yuzuki,

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.290
and Tama,

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.010
and everyone else who became a LRIG.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.970
I want you all to be returned to your own worlds!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.720
That's my wish!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.810
No matter what I have to sacrifice,

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.390
that's my one and only wish!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.020
Ruu...

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.480
I appreciate the sentiment,

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.440
but it's impossible.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.110
Why?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.070
As I said before,

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.240
Eternal Girls were originally LRIGs.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:10.370
And LRIGs were originally ordinary girls, just like me.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:15.580
A wish that can't be made true
by a normal girl can't come true.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.800
There are some wishes that can never come true, right?

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.590
For example, wanting to time travel.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.390
It's as you say.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.680
However, it is not up to me to decide that.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:31.850
What?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.480
Thinking of the wishes the girls put on the line in Selector battles,

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:42.190
most of them are not
particularly difficult to grant.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.190
Common sense, self-preservation...

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:48.450
It's aspects like these that
prevent wishes from coming true.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.490
Still,

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.740
a LRIG must not be bound by such things.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.500
If one continues to reject their Selector's wish,

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:02.250
she will never be able to leave her card.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.090
LRIGs who wish to return to the outside world

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:10.390
grasp onto any wish with even the slightest chance of coming true.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:15.270
For that wish to come true,
any underhanded deed may be taken.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.430
That's...

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.900
And that is the very reason for the ritual of acknowledgment.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:25.610
It is required as the final trigger.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.360
<i>Now, let's say it together.</i>

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.410
<i>I accept...</i>

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.620
<i>I... accept!</i>

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.450
<i>the Laws of the Selector.</i>

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.120
<i>The Laws of the Selector.</i>

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.080
<i>And now!</i>

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.080
<i>A new Eternal Girl will be born!
A new Eternal Girl will be born!</i>

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.960
Once an Eternal Girl,

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.170
she is obligated to make a wish come true.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:53.140
If, after the wish is accepted and the contract completed

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.390
the wish can <i>not</i> be granted,

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.390
the Eternal Girl disappears.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.850
Remember what Hanayo-san said before?

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:05.780
How Hitoe's memory can't be restored?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:09.530
That's because Hanayo-san judged it couldn't happen.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.660
What about my wish, then?

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:16.160
I have no idea how to release all the LRIGs from their cards.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:19.580
That girl might know how, though.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:23.580
But I don't know how to find her again.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.090
I might be able to do it.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.170
I'm not sure, but...

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:35.970
I feel like I know how to make the LRIGs return to normal.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:36.930
What do you mean?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.430
I don't know!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.890
But I feel like I can do it somehow...

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.230
I thought... I could...

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.070
Tama...

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.860
Maybe...

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.740
That's stupid!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.870
It was all for nothing!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.910
There was no need for us to go through all these battles!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.580
A wish anyone can grant
just by putting some effort in...

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:06.210
But we become cards, disappear, and lose everything...

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.750
There are exceptions.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:14.760
Not all Eternal Girls are normal girls.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.600
Among them

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:21.020
may be special girls who hold mysterious powers.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:25.650
What are these "mysterious powers," now?!
That's just ridiculous!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:28.320
Despite being turned into a LRIG,

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.780
do you still attempt to deny the mysterious?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.360
It's about time.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:47.040
Your dawn as a LRIG card and the
meeting with your Selector has come.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.040
W-Wait! Who <i>are</i>—

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.140
I will always be here.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:08.480
Here, in the rift between the world of the cards and the world of reality.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.400
Now then,

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.570
good morning.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.950
Tama is somehow different from other LRIGs.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.790
Maybe she's one of those "special girls" that girl was talking about.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.460
Then my wish can...

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.420
You can't.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.050
Did you forget?

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.960
If your wish comes true, you'll become a LRIG!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.300
But...

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:41.310
if my wish is to release all the LRIGs from their cards,

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.430
I may not become a card at all!

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.060
But can you <i>know</i> that?

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.850
For all we know, you could end up sealed away as a sacrifice—

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.440
or something even worse!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.860
But... But!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.490
Let's give it some more thought, Ruuko.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.780
<i>We</i> may meet again,

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.820
and we may talk like this again, too...

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.120
But...

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:07.960
you may not meet those who aren't Selectors, like your grandma, ever again.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.140
Hitoe?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.900
That's my LRIG, isn't it?

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.900
Hitoe, I...

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.150
Please give me back my LRIG.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:39.280
Hitoe?!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.280
Hitoe! Listen to me!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.500
U-Um, Hitoe? I...

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.460
I have nothing to discuss with you.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:50.620
Hitoe!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.130
Wait!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.260
Hitoe?

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:07.560
I will participate in Urazoe Iona's fan gathering.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.020
If you want to talk,

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.900
we can do it on the battlefield.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:28.790
<i>If my wish comes true...</i>

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.550
<i>Grandma will...</i>

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.170
I'm ba—

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.630
My, it's you.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.850
She's doing fine.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.810
She made friends, too.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.640
Yes, right.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.360
Stop with that, please.
A long time has passed since then.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.940
There's no point in blaming yourself.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.070
But...

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.450
please stop acting as if you're a mother.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:07.160
It just wasn't in you to become a parent.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:07.950
Notices
Message Memory
<b>Miyako Cell
It just wasn't in you to become a parent.</b>

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.040
You weren't meant to be one.
<b>Miyako Cell
Message Memory
Notices</b>

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.330
Moreover...
<b>Miyako Cell
Message Memory
Notices</b>

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:18.090
Ruuko is neither the adult
nor the child you take her for.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.430
Ah, right... I'll call you back.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.430
Well then.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:29.100
Ruu-chan, dinner is ready.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.520
Mom?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.190
You know, I have a wish now.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.110
A wish?

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.610
You know, when I was a little kid...

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:47.910
Mom and Dad used to fight all the time.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.080
It was really sad.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:56.000
I knew that Dad and Mom really
wanted to feel close to each other.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.460
But watching them fight still made me sad.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:06.050
I figured that wanting to be close to someone makes things painful.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:12.140
So I thought that I didn't need anyone else but you and my brother.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.020
But...

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:19.060
Ruu-chan, you told me you wanted to do something for your friends, right?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.900
Is your wish about that?

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.490
Is it something bad?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.240
It's not!

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.200
Is it something good, then?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:35.370
I think it's something good... I'm sure it is.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:42.460
You know, Ruu-chan, you're my treasure.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.220
If you think something is good,

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:48.470
then I think that something is wonderful.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:52.430
Do what you need to do.
Your wish will come true.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:56.600
Especially since you're such a kind girl.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.900
Grandma...

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:01.270
My, what a huge baby I have here.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.530
Ruu?

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.950
Are you really going to battle?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.910
Yup.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.670
We can battle Iona-san again, Tama.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.630
I bet you can't wait!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.800
I don't want to battle!

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.510
Grandma said all that because she doesn't know!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:29.050
If she knew, she'd say no!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:33.390
I want to be Ruu's LRIG!
I want to be with Ruu forever!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:38.520
Grandma and I, we don't want to ever be away from you!

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.820
Tama, I'm sure it'll be okay.

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.780
But Yuzuki said you can't know that!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.450
You know, when my wish comes true,

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.790
and I don't become a card but stay as myself,

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.200
then...

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.660
let's stay together forever.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.420
Tama, you can live with me, too.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.010
We'll have breakfast together...

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.930
We'll go to school together...

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:18.480
We'll be friends with Yuzuki and Hitoe...

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:27.110
It's closed now, but during summer, the candy store at the corner sells really good soft-serve ice cream.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:31.360
We'll buy some together on the way home.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.540
So, please...

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:40.660
I...

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.420
don't like it.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.340
I don't.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.210
<i>And yet...</i>

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.220
<i>Tama,</i>

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:54.680
<i>I... have to go.</i>

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.720
Take care, Ruu-chan.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.060
Okay.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.020
Will you be back by dinner?

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.230
Dinner...

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.480
I want to eat potato gratin!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.610
With plenty of bacon, right?

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.360
Yup!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.320
I'm going now!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.870
<i>I made a decision, so I need to go.</i>

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.590
<i>Everyone here knows</i>

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:36.050
<i>that we're all Selectors.</i>

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.230
Welcome to the fan gathering, everybody—

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:51.740
No,

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:54.490
welcome to our Selector-only WIXOSS Party.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.280
This building is owned by my father.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.370
Construction work has been halted for the day.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.960
No one will get in our way.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.920
We are battling for our respective wishes.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.590
But we don't know how many wins we need.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:13.130
Our conditions are unclear.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:16.890
I believe everyone present is frustrated by this.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:20.720
However, with this many Selectors gathered in one place,

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:25.440
some here are bound to meet their conditions.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:30.020
Today, several Eternal Girls will be born.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.990
Several Eternal Girls?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:38.410
But for every victress, there must also be a loser.

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:43.500
I do not intend to have anyone lose her rights to become an Eternal Girl through random battles.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.000
The battles will be undertaken in the form of a tournament.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:53.800
I will ask you to leave the battles if you lose.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:57.340
This is to prevent unnecessary sacrifices.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.850
Whichever Selector makes it to the end

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.640
will enter a battle against me.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.320
Twelfth floor, number four?

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:25.790
Are you all ready? Now then...

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.000
Let the battles begin.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:30.960
Open!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.640
Tama. Grow!

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.970
Gothic Boundary!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.560
I'm sorry!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.400
I'll win this all and save you and everyone else!

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.400
I summon Mitsurugi!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.980
This is the final blow, Tama!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:56.110
Tama?

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.160
Tama...

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.000
<i>Tama needs to agree with me,</i>

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.210
<i>or else my wish won't come true.</i>

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.840
<i>I'm sorry, Tama!</i>

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.130
Konaka
Kominato
Naruse
Akane

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.590
<i>I still...
Konaka
Kominato
Naruse
Akane</i>

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.340
<i>need to keep battling.</i>

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.690
It looks like we meet again.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.820
You're willing to talk now, aren't you?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.150
We'll talk on the battlefield.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.330
Open!
Open!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.420
There's no indication of any
Eternal Girls being born.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.460
Yes...

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:01.260
But it looks like some Selectors have lost their third battles.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.520
I'm going to go there.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.440
I will reach that white room.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.520
The place where she's waiting.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.650
I bounce Suberia! Attack!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.400
Yuzuki. Grow!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.320
Banish Mikagami.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.580
<i>Hitoe...</i>

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.370
<i>She's a lot better now!</i>

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.830
Severing Steamroll.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.630
Tama, I'm sorry!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.970
Yuzuki, attack. Banish Square!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:45.890
Hitoe...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.430
This...

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.560
is different.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:51.100
What is different?

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:56.980
It's different from... when you and Yuzuki and I battled!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.110
Ruuko...

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:04.360
We had so much fun playing WIXOSS together!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:11.450
But back then, I thought that wasn't enough.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.660
I wanted to battle more seriously.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.080
Ruuko...

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.370
But now

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:20.130
when I think we'll never battle like that again...

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.880
Never again...

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.010
I knew it.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.550
Hitoe...

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:33.810
still has memories of us.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:35.310
Yuzuki?

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:39.940
Hitoe, listen to me! We three used to be friends!

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:41.980
Yuzuki!

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:44.740
It hurts, doesn't it? Forgive me.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.860
But I want you to remember!

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:50.330
Y-Yuzuki, Hitoe is suffering—

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.990
Ruuko! Do you want her to stay like this?!

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:57.040
Being controlled by Selector battles...

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.420
And just when we finally became friends...

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:06.420
I want to have battles with Hitoe and Yuzuki like the ones we used to have!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.340
I want us to battle as <i>friends</i>!

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:10.350
Stop... Stop!

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:12.760
Hitoe! Please remember!

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:15.520
Your wish already came true!

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:18.350
You don't need the cards for that! It's already true!

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:20.730
No... no... no!

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:22.770
Hitoe, don't give up!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:24.360
Then, we'll once again—

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:25.190
Just shut up!

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.240
Hitoe!

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:28.360
I don't want to hear any more of this!

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:31.240
I... I want to make my wish come true!

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:33.990
I'm telling you that your wish already came true!

00:22:33.990 --> 00:22:34.540
Just listen to—

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:35.410
No!

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:39.830
Please... Please!

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:43.040
Let me have my wish come true!

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:46.970
Hitoe...?

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:50.050
Hitoe?

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:52.180
That scrunchie!

00:22:54.350 --> 00:22:57.480
Now then... isn't it about time?

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:02.480
This will be

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.190
my final battle as Urazoe Iona.

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:07.740
Yes...

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:11.490
I enjoyed battling by your side, Iona.

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:14.490
You were lovely to be with, you <i>scum</i>.

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:21.460
I will accompany you to the very end,

